WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.447
A public campaign names techniques. It does not supply a runnable sequence or its environment bindings.

00:07.447 --> 00:17.036
The versioned catalog supports 252 of 1146 corpus steps. Unsupported steps remain visible.

00:17.036 --> 00:27.257
A proposer can suggest a procedure. The verifier checks its bindings, preconditions, execution scope, and evidence obligations.

00:27.257 --> 00:37.676
In three fully supported campaigns, raw STIX admits 0 of 25 steps. Reconstructed contracts admit 25 of 25.

00:37.676 --> 00:45.257
The output records each binding and its provenance. Runtime effect requires a separate observed execution.
